{"availability":"available","full":"anweshdash06-del/Swasthya-Setu","name":"Swasthya-Setu","description":"An AI-assisted, multilingual healthcare triage web app that helps patients report symptoms in their own language and helps healthcare workers prioritize care faster — safely, transparently, and without ever making a diagnosis.","category":"Design","language":"JavaScript","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2026-09-27T04:55:49Z","updated":"2026-10-10T10:26:52Z","branch":"main","homepage":"https://swasthya-setu-weld.vercel.app","topics":["html-css-javascript","reactsjs","vercel","vitejs"],"demo":"https://swasthya-setu-weld.vercel.app/","color":"#25392f","ink":"#d1e5c5","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-12T07:59:54.740Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-12T07:59:54.740Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-12T07:59:54.740Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-12T07:59:54.740Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Smart India Hackathon Prototype — PS03: Multimodal Healthcare Triage Assistant for Government and Institutional Health Facilities","⚠️ AI-Assisted Triage — Not AI Diagnosis. This system organizes patient-reported information and highlights urgency signals so a qualified healthcare worker can review faster. It never diagnoses, prescribes, or replaces a doctor, nurse, or medical officer. Every AI-generated note requires human review and sign-off before any clinical action is taken. All data in this demo is synthetic — do not enter real patient information."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/anweshdash06-del/Swasthya-Setu/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"2df1dcbe6298b29ee5325ee7b57a6e2508e1b296bee334c12eb09d25fe75ed1c","extractedAt":"2026-10-12T07:59:54.873Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-12T07:59:54.873Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Smart India Hackathon Prototype — PS03: Multimodal Healthcare Triage Assistant for Government and Institutional Health Facilities","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/anweshda